"},"originalCharacterName":"アコ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's wife whom he meet the first time during their school days . A career woman who works hard. In her private time, she spends her days relaxing, being a little sloppy, and being lovey-dovey with her husband (Who she loves with all her heart)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In housekeeping, she is tasked with washing and cleaning - while her husband does the cooking. It's not that she can't cook, but because sometimes she can't make it home early enough to do so."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sometimes, she unexpectedly overreacts with her expressions, but because of this she becomes someone who is easy to understand."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65052"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"平時は頑張るキャリアウーマンで主人公のお嫁さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、私生活では少しだらしなく、ぐでっとしたり、旦那といちゃいちゃしたりと自由気ままな日々を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは学生時代に知り合い、そのまま結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達としても、恋人としても、愛する人としても全ての一番に夫がくるほど夫を愛していて、二人の時間を最も大切にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は洗濯や掃除を担当し、料理は旦那に任せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理ができないわけではないが、帰る時間が大体後ということもあってたまにしかやらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外とオーバーリアクションが多かったりと表情豊かだが、結果として何を考えてるかわかりやすい性格をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17979","sourceWorkId":"26052","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長：163cm　血液型：O型"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなもの：旦那、甘いもの　嫌いなもの：旦那との時間を邪魔するもの"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：楽しいことと旦那と戯れること　長所：自由奔放なところ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"短所：家では自堕落なところ（そこも可愛い）　弱点：虫"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お酒：結構強い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平時は頑張るキャリアウーマンで主人公のお嫁さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、私生活では少しだらしなく、ぐでっとしたり、旦那といちゃいちゃしたりと自由気ままな日々を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは学生時代に知り合い、そのまま結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達としても、恋人としても、愛する人としても、全ての一番に夫がくるほど夫を愛していて、二人の時間を最も大切にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は洗濯や掃除を担当し、料理は旦那に任せている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理ができないわけではないが、帰る時間が大体後ということもあってたまにしかやらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外とオーバーリアクションが多かったりと表情豊かだが、結果として何を考えてるかわかりやすい性格をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59240"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17979","sourceWorkId":"26052","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3ac69da9f5cf9e2e40adf77a26d921a9b692926d9bcd02d260d5bd90c194e82.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29ccfa8bd377c0d167aa571e5e19f88cf10d9cf850572526ab38d49e549a0e12.webp","width":78,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水野七海","creatorId":"vndb:s2524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2524","name":"星野七海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230199:59240:17078:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p7288","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5573","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7288","name":"はちみつそふと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:26052:5573","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p6087","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p6087","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p6087","name":"心愿屋汉化组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:123832:v22075","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p96","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p96","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p96","name":"きゃんでぃそふと","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-produce